CVE-2026-39822
CVE-2026-56852

# npm 12.0.1's own bundled brace-expansion (5.0.7, under
# /usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm/node_modules/) carries this CVE. `npm install -g
# npm@12.0.2` (the only newer patch available as of 2026-08-01) does not replace it —
# npm's self-upgrade leaves its own currently-running install directory untouched, a
# known npm limitation, not something this Dockerfile can force. Not our code to patch
# directly; tracked for the next Node/npm version bump. Re-review 2026-11-01.
CVE-2026-14257
